{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>鄺港傑自辯 前夫鄺港智 小男人 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）2023年2月 …</p><p></p>\n<p>鄺港傑自辯 前夫鄺港智 小男人 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）2023年2月遇害肢解，前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前大伯鄺港傑否認謀殺罪，案件審訊踏入第34日，被告鄺港傑繼續出庭自辯。 </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8b-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e6%83%85%e5%a9%a6-2454035/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑爆胞弟有女友 蔡知情後曾向子女哭訴 鄺球被逐出豪宅「住情婦屋企」導火線</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港傑稱蔡天鳳常只向胞弟宣洩情緒</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑供稱，2023年農曆大年初一，鄺家3父子帶同蔡天鳳兩名子女到荃灣冒險樂園遊玩，當時身處法國的蔡天鳳先致電李瑞香，希望視像見見仔女，但對方未有直接交代情況。蔡天鳳其後再聯絡鄺港傑，獲告知可致電鄺港智Alex，惟接連2、3次仍未能與子女通話，情緒開始變得不滿，「開始嬲㗎喇著(生氣)喇，打咗2、3個電話都未成功同到小朋友講嘢」。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%99%aa%e5%af%a9%e5%93%a1-%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e7%90%86%e7%94%b1-%e6%b3%95%e5%ae%98-%e9%ab%98%e7%ad%89%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-2453977/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案續審前法官解除1陪審員職務「不適合繼續擔任」理由曝光</a></p>\n<p>鄺港傑續指，蔡天鳳從法國回港後沒有討論過此事，又指通常向弟弟宣洩不滿情緒，「通常唔會同我表達唔高興，通常都係卸晒落細佬度」。他又提到，蔡天鳳回港後曾在加多利山住所質問鄺港智：「點解又帶小朋友瞞住我見爺爺呀？你明知我唔畀佢哋見爺爺㗎啦。」</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%a6%aa%e5%85%84%e5%a6%b9-%e8%b5%b4%e7%be%8e%e5%8d%87%e5%ad%b8-%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e9%84%ba-2453477/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑身世學歷家庭背景 8字剖白與蔡天鳳關係 母親李瑞香職業首曝光</a></p>\n<h2>蔡天鳳私下真面目 鄺港傑自認在鄺家身份特殊</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑在庭上形容胞弟與蔡天鳳平日的相處模式，他指出弟弟鄺港智在家中屬於「比較小男人角色」，蔡天鳳則較「強勢少少」，兩人相處時往往由蔡表達不滿，「偏向嫌呀、鬧呀咁樣」，鄺港智則沉默聽著，逆來順受，多年來甚少反駁，「Abby有Abby講，佢唔出聲照聽」。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%aa%8d%e7%bd%aa-%e5%9f%8b%e8%91%ac%e5%b1%8d%e9%ab%94-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2450408/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</a></p>\n<p>鄺港傑又供稱，自己曾私下勸弟弟「你似返個男人啦，你唔可以成日俾人鬧㗎喎」，鄺港智則回應：「算啦，佢係咁㗎喇，咁多年都係咁㗎喇。」</p>\n<p>此外，鄺港傑亦稱自己在鄺家中身份較為特殊，自己既是鄺家成員，也是蔡天鳳好友，並有協助照顧兩名侄子女，因此較少成為蔡責備對象，「（蔡）無呢個資格咁樣話我。」 </p>\n<p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179204138856915427_819011266ad061ad380b4.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 真面目 28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179204138856915427_819011266ad061ad380b4.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）</figcaption></figure>\n</p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e8%b3%ad%e9%8c%a2-500%e8%90%ac%e8%b3%ad%e5%82%b5-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e7%84%a1%e8%a8%bb%e5%86%8a-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2443847/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜丈夫譚方駿與蔡天鳳無註冊原因  譚家被上門收數 譚父曾向鄺球求助</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%8b%9c%e8%a7%80%e9%9f%b3-%e7%b6%93%e6%96%87%e8%a1%a3%e7%b4%99-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%96-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-2451997/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜龍尾村單位藏經文衣紙 主控問有否嬰兒出世獲5字回答 鄺球父子曾帶嬰兒浴盆入屋</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e5%90%8d%e4%b8%8b-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-2442309/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜豪宅登記鄺球名下始末 豪宅出資人並非蔡天鳳 蔡母揭女兒收入來源：未婚前已有「億幾兩億」</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ba%ab%e4%b8%96-%e5%ae%b6%e5%ba%ad%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2440816/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜控方揭蔡天鳳身世學歷背景 買豪宅另有苦衷 母女訊息惹關注 拆解鄺家奪命計劃</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%ad%bb%e5%9b%a0-%e5%a5%b3%e6%b3%95%e9%86%ab%e9%83%ad%e5%98%89%e7%90%aa-%e9%a0%ad%e9%83%a8-%e5%a4%a7%e5%b0%8f%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e7%a2%8e%e5%b1%8d-%e9%9d%92%e7%b4%85-2452341/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜女法醫親解蔡天鳳真正死因 生前頭部7次重擊 網民痛斥鄺家</a><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e5%a4%b1%e8%b9%a4-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e5%85%ac%e7%9c%be%e5%b8%ad%e7%ac%91-2442712/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>\n</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e5%a7%91%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e5%88%a4%e6%b1%ba-%e5%85%92%e5%ad%90%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab-cctv-2451516/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜案發後鄺港智與母關鍵對話 李瑞香判決！法官：慈母多敗兒</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%90%88%e7%85%a7-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e8%a6%aa%e5%af%86%e6%9c%8b%e5%8f%8b-2450674/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳鄺港傑多張合照庭上曝光 譚方駿首回應二人真實關係 警公開鄺最後接觸蔡衣服</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%90%8d%e9%8c%b6-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e4%ba%a4%e6%98%93-%e9%99%b3%e4%ba%ae%e6%81%92-damon-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-2447584/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前妻遇害後 名錶職員揭鄺港智異常舉止 提出1大古怪要求：我照做</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%ad%a4%e6%83%85%e4%b8%8d%e5%86%8d-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-2446053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿稱與鄺港智「此情不再」剖白關係變化內情 1事令關係逆轉：我打咗個突</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e5%85%a8%e5%ae%b6%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1-%e7%a7%bb%e6%b0%91%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b-%e9%84%ba%e8%ad%9a%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e9%84%ba-2445666/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿首披露帶妻及4子女全家移英計劃 蔡天鳳拒鄺譚子女同住原因</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab-%e6%be%b3%e6%b4%b2%e7%95%99%e5%ad%b8-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%b9%bc%e5%ad%90%e7%b9%bc%e5%a5%b3-2444979/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿出庭作供剖白與蔡天鳳相識經過 揭蔡11字回應鄺港智突失蹤7年</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">前夫鄺港智</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%b0%8f%e7%94%b7%e4%ba%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">小男人</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%9c%9f%e9%9d%a2%e7%9b%ae/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">真面目</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/2454105\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於SundayKiss</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a>\nNov 10 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:22:56.266069+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1524,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:42:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:16:01.828319+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T15:16:01.828319+00:00","content_hash":"c179ee1d55ac546cfe63ba69bb361c5a82d4c7c48c0e0af39896056b894955ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}